      "supported_claims": [
        "Half-half donors give stipulated20thousandUSD gap; donor contamination reduces it to10 and postoutcome weight selection to0.",
        "Rank-count fractions1/5 and1/2 differ with retained denominator; no calibration claimed."
      ],
      "limitations": [
